1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:04,800
How many years does it take to grow a tree?

2
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:08,800
And how far must a man walk?

3
00:00:13,267 --> 00:00:16,367
Four hundred million years ago: barren land.

4
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:19,800
Plants built bones: lignin.

5
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:25,800
And so, the Earth grew its first forest.

6
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:30,800
Humanity's first warmth came from a piece of wood.

7
00:00:31,267 --> 00:00:35,800
Eight thousand years ago in Zhejiang, a log became a boat.

8
00:00:36,267 --> 00:00:39,667
Seven thousand years ago, Hemudu invented mortise joints.

9
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:42,800
No nails: wood holding wood.

10
00:00:43,267 --> 00:00:46,833
Six centuries ago, brackets lifted the Forbidden City's eaves.

11
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:49,800
Wood is flexible, warm, reassuring.

12
00:00:50,267 --> 00:00:54,800
Generations have lived in wood, warmed by it.

13
00:00:55,267 --> 00:00:59,800
Carl Lu was born in 1966, to a Wenzhou merchant family.

14
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:03,367
He studied shipbuilding, learning water and wood.

15
00:01:03,367 --> 00:01:05,800
A seed was planted.

16
00:01:06,267 --> 00:01:09,867
In 1988, he joined Wenzhou's fishing-vessel inspection office.

17
00:01:09,867 --> 00:01:12,800
Six years inspecting, boat after boat.

18
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:16,267
In 1994, he left security for wood.

19
00:01:16,767 --> 00:01:23,300
On April 8, 1994, a 28-square-meter flooring shop opened on a Wenzhou street.

20
00:01:23,767 --> 00:01:27,600
He designed the Anxin mark: a tree of floorboards.

21
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:31,300
Floors come from trees. Trust, like trees, grows slowly.

22
00:01:31,767 --> 00:01:34,867
In 1998, the state banned logging.

23
00:01:34,867 --> 00:01:37,300
His supply was cut off.

24
00:01:37,767 --> 00:01:43,300
He wanted to import from Brazil, but middlemen held every overseas source.

25
00:01:43,767 --> 00:01:49,300
Among the dockworkers, he searched crate after crate for a single clue.

26
00:01:49,767 --> 00:01:55,300
In July 1998, a roll of tape gave him a Brazilian supplier's number.

27
00:01:55,767 --> 00:01:58,833
Neither spoke the other's language.

28
00:01:58,833 --> 00:02:02,300
Eleven hours apart, he kept dialing.

29
00:02:02,767 --> 00:02:05,400
Weeks later, the fax rang.

30
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:08,300
Luis, in Brazil, sent a quote.

31
00:02:08,767 --> 00:02:11,133
It came from South America.

32
00:02:11,133 --> 00:02:15,300
Tens of millions of years of rain raised the Amazon.

33
00:02:15,767 --> 00:02:21,300
Reaching for a ray of light, each tree grew into its own shape.

34
00:02:21,767 --> 00:02:29,300
A tree four hundred million years in the making met the man who came looking for it.

35
00:02:29,767 --> 00:02:34,300
In the rainforest, he found the perfect wood.

36
00:02:34,767 --> 00:02:38,600
With Luis, he built a mill beside the rainforest.

37
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:42,300
Plan, then harvest. Take only what the forest gives.

38
00:02:42,767 --> 00:02:47,833
Satellites divide the forest into 25 plots, one harvested yearly, then replanted.

39
00:02:47,833 --> 00:02:51,300
A 25-year cycle, and the forest lives on.

40
00:02:51,767 --> 00:02:56,300
In 1999, he built his own factory in Qingpu, Shanghai.

41
00:02:56,767 --> 00:03:00,533
From Wenzhou to the Americas, and on to Africa,

42
00:03:00,533 --> 00:03:04,300
Anxin sent its roots ever farther.

43
00:03:04,767 --> 00:03:08,867
Olympic venues, the Shanghai Expo Center, bespoke whole-wood interiors —

44
00:03:08,867 --> 00:03:12,300
it became the ground beneath many landmark places.

45
00:03:12,767 --> 00:03:19,300
After ten years in the U.S., his elder son Ben returned in 2017.

46
00:03:19,767 --> 00:03:22,600
Father and son often argued fiercely.

47
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:27,300
If he's right, I accept, or we won't last a century.

48
00:03:27,767 --> 00:03:31,867
In 2022, Ben Lu became president.

49
00:03:31,867 --> 00:03:36,300
From conflict to understanding — each other's support, each other's armor.

50
00:03:36,767 --> 00:03:43,300
Trust transcends every language.

51
00:03:43,767 --> 00:03:53,300
A warmer, healthier living space — for everyone.

52
00:03:53,767 --> 00:03:56,167
Anxin Flooring.

53
00:03:56,167 --> 00:04:01,300
The tree's secret is time. The man's secret is one word: trust.

